{
  "id": 434636192,
  "iid": 22398,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "hex data source view: support show text as UTF8",
  "description": "Currently, the hex data source view can display text using frame\nencodings such as ASCII and EBCDIC. However, in a Unicode environment,\nthe ASCII view renders most characters as dots, making the content\ndifficult to interpret. It would be more convenient to display the\npayload as UTF-8 characters so that the content can be understood at a\nglance.\n\n1. Add the option to show as UTF8\n![image](/uploads/3e75a1af57c3935b03c119c1ee2e4a49/image.png){width=676 height=600}\n\n2. Support hover over a character, would highlight the related bytes.\n![image](/uploads/1d1660ea064202ebe2ec901a3d4124e7/image.png){width=900 height=474}\n\n3. A utf8 demo pcap\n\n[utf8.pcapng](/uploads/c6d691bbe5d9a169f5e4b81a226e20cb/utf8.pcapng)",
  "state": "opened",
