    {
      "id": "3a8eb96b46f9f2fc2acea3cea4a08de8df4e76c0",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 2916989169,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Here's a case that messes up with bidirectional characters (Hebrew, here): [ping_bidi.pcapng](/uploads/808b968293e80cfd885b5ed4ba109186/ping_bidi.pcapng)\n\n![image](/uploads/d292a27911b533d533b7a14705480ede/image.png){width=702 height=97}\n\nd790 is Alef ( א ), but because of the Right-to-Left display, the box is being drawn at the wrong place (on the left, when it's the first of three RTL characters and hence on the far right) so it partially is around the character Gimel ( ג ) though since the calculations aren't fixed width it bleeds over. (Notice how the RTL changes a bit when the Hebrew characters are split up on different lines.)\n\nNote with some of these files I can get crashes with:\n\n```\n ** (wireshark:2191970) 21:27:40.694472 [GUI ERROR] /usr/include/qt6/QtCore/qbytearray.h:596 -- ASSERT: \"n <= d.size - pos\" in file /usr/include/qt6/QtCore/qbytearray.h, line 596\n ** (wireshark:2191970) Aborting on fatal log level exception\n```\n\nrelevant part of backtrace below:\n```\n#11 QByteArray::operator[] (this=0x7d2fd44fe628, i=54)\n    at /usr/include/qt6/QtCore/qbytearray.h:682\n#12 0x0000555556c16421 in HexDataSourceView::isPartOfHoveredUtf8Char\n    (this=0x7d2fd44fe600, byte_offset=0)\n    at /home/johnthacker/wireshark/ui/qt/widgets/hex_data_source_view.cpp:233\n#13 0x0000555556c18b7a in HexDataSourceView::computeLineLayout\n    (this=0x7d2fd44fe600, row_offset=0, build_x_pos=true)\n    at /home/johnthacker/wireshark/ui/qt/widgets/hex_data_source_view.cpp:618\n#14 0x0000555556c1e10a in HexDataSourceView::drawLine\n    (this=0x7d2fd44fe600, painter=0x7bffd26e3620, offset=0, row_y=0)\n    at /home/johnthacker/wireshark/ui/qt/widgets/hex_data_source_view.cpp:798\n#15 0x0000555556c1cff2 in HexDataSourceView::paintEvent (this=0x7d2fd44fe600)\n```",
          "author": {
            "id": 6764551,
            "username": "johnthacker",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "John Thacker",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/99c30adacedf45514aaf711ba8a44f56322ebb53e9b550b7e3c9cd83bd6a1408?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/johnthacker"
          },
          "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:37:03.038Z",
