      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 2917010172,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Emoji, including combining ones, and using characters outside the Base Multilingual Plane: [ping_emoji_not_bmp.pcapng](/uploads/45e0f3ffdfbc8f303fa81fab08997cbf/ping_emoji_not_bmp.pcapng)\n\nFrame 1, not highlighted:\n![image](/uploads/28ec57f9774edd01e9fd95d811ace9cd/image.png){width=702 height=97}\n\nFrame 1, highlighted:\n![image](/uploads/ddd7df039f7664fdfc16513d845bb74a/image.png){width=702 height=97}\n\nFrame 3, not highlighted:\n![image](/uploads/317c2b5da511f95e9f3008114893b561/image.png){width=702 height=97}\n\nFrame 3, highlighted:\n![image](/uploads/712dc1f8551f1d0da9ec252679b51b43/image.png){width=702 height=97}\n\nFrame 5, not highlighted:\n![image](/uploads/bb12befab5a844ddb4fd0aac6d199032/image.png){width=702 height=97}\n\nFrame 5, highlighted:\n![image](/uploads/1c3c3cacba6b7ea702acc32560d743ac/image.png){width=702 height=97}",
