        {
          "id": 2917033509,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Characters that are taller than the other glyphs in the font: [ping_tall_glyphs.pcapng](/uploads/4bfff5de2d9e16baef2d428459668b69/ping_tall_glyphs.pcapng)\n\nDoesn't seem like the black outline box height is correct in that case:\n\n![image](/uploads/0ef61bd457e63a97f69568de63c893ec/image.png){width=702 height=97}",
