      "title": "hex data source view: support show text as UTF8",
      "message": "hex data source view: support show text as UTF8\n\nCurrently, the hex data source view can display text using frame\nencodings such as ASCII and EBCDIC. However, in a Unicode environment,\nthe ASCII view renders most characters as dots, making the content\ndifficult to interpret. It would be more convenient to display the\npayload as UTF-8 characters so that the content can be understood at a\nglance.\n",
      "author_name": "Jinzhou Zhang",
